{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/db63d2fdbc8317753de8bd5b2b8daffc.avif?t=1773997168\" width=800 height=70 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/c1838380a642971cc70279b06a731d2b.avif?t=1773997168\" width=800 height=444 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce2\u3010Game Introduction\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2666 The protagonist ends an ordinary day and falls asleep\u2014<br>Only to awaken in a strange, unfamiliar prison, not their usual room.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With memories still hazy and a monster in pursuit, death seems inevitable\u2014<br>Until four strangers appear before them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is then that the protagonist realizes:<br>This place is the world of an RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Welcome to the world of \u300aTime in Wonderland\u300b!</i><br><br><i>You have been chosen as the hero who will save Wonderland from the tyrant, the Heart Queen.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83d\udce2\u3010System Overview\u3011</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u300eRe.dive Wonderland\u300f is an otome game where two parts alternate:<br>A <strong>pixel-art style mystery adventure and minigame</strong> segment that the player can control directly,<br>and a <strong>visual novel</strong> part rich in story and emotion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices may lead you on a journey toward the truth of the world,<br>or guide you straight into unexpected bad endings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every story is shaped by the choices <strong>you</strong> make.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >--------------------------------------------------------------------------</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2666 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc07\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11 \ud835\udfec\ud835\udfed \u2666</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/66b6eb05b37fe205f9c6ac419c5fbedd.avif?t=1773997168\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist of the story: <strong>Carol</strong><br>(*Name can be changed)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;If this is all just a dream... do I even want to wake up?&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/14f78094e1af1c3926b57187577d8dc6.avif?t=1773997168\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras_big/14f78094e1af1c3926b57187577d8dc6.avif?t=1773997168 width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2666 \ud835\udc02\ud835\udc07\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc11\ud835\udc00\ud835\udc02\ud835\udc13\ud835\udc04\ud835\udc11 \ud835\udfec\ud835\udfee \u2666</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/510a6959f6e4d3345bc16f2ff24c2675.avif?t=1773997168\" width=150 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The cheerful mood-maker: <strong>Raven</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>&quot;Relax and enjoy it. We've got your back.&quot;</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3625350/extras/0406a6f749b398df2f73495637b5eef9.avif?t=1773997168\" data-big-src=h